.TH orbweaver-schemas 1  "schemas " 
.SH NAME
schemas \- 📐 List the data schemas detected in a snapshot
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBschemas\fR [\fB\-\-snapshot\fR] [\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
📐 List the data schemas detected in a snapshot
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-snapshot\fR \fI<SNAPSHOT>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<REPO>\fR
